#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Dukungan {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr "Dapatkan bantuan untuk IBM Quantum Platform dan Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, program khusus, dan Open Plan (tidak termasuk akun Trial):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) or a Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Ensure you have selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgid "All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Quantum Compute) or a Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Quantum Compute). Ensure you have selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr "Semua pertanyaan dukungan harus diajukan melalui [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Tergantung jenis akunmu, kamu bisa membuka Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) atau Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Pastikan kamu sudah memilih akun IBM Cloud yang tepat (akun cloud institusimu atau akun non-trial apa pun) di pemilih akun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat semua kasus IBM Cloud-mu yang masih terbuka atau membuka kasus baru, kunjungi [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of topics.\n"
msgstr "Silakan hubungi kami untuk masalah teknis apa pun, termasuk masalah platform, error job, panduan Qiskit, atau pertanyaan komputasi kuantum yang lebih luas. Tim kami terdiri dari pakar teknis yang siap membantu di semua topik tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Dukungan komunitas:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr "Punya akun Trial atau mencari opsi dukungan lain? [Bergabung dengan komunitas Qiskit Slack](https://qisk.it/join-slack) untuk mendapatkan bantuan dari komunitas pengguna dan pakar kami yang besar. Di Slack kamu akan menemukan channel tematik seperti #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, dan banyak lagi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-related questions.\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa menggunakan [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) untuk mendapatkan dukungan dari komunitas yang lebih luas tentang pertanyaan terkait komputasi kuantum dan pemrograman.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr "Kesulitan membuat akun atau masuk? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first check whether you have access to the [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr "**Jika kamu mendapat error saat membuat akun IBM Cloud&reg;,** pertama-tama periksa apakah kamu punya akses ke [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) di IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu punya akses ke halaman \"Create Case\", pilih Account (Managing your account and resources) sebagai kategori, lalu Account verification sebagai Subtopic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr "Jika tidak punya akses, buka kasus di halaman [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your country is on the [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following options:\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu mendapat error saat mencoba membuat akun dan **negaramu ada di daftar [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts),** coba opsi berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources without an account.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan sumber daya [Documentation](/docs) dan [Learning](/learning) tanpa akun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access account](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more information).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu seorang pelajar atau pengajar di institusi akademik terakreditasi yang memberikan gelar, kamu bisa membuat [akun SkillsBuild Technology Access](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (lihat [SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) untuk informasi lebih lanjut).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the trial).\n"
msgstr "[Buat akun Trial](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) untuk akses gratis 30 hari (Perlu diingat bahwa kamu kemungkinan akan kehilangan akses di akhir masa trial).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to complete in your account.\n"
msgstr "**Jika kamu melihat pesan \"This account is inactive\",** kunjungi [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) untuk mempelajari penyebabnya dan cara memperbaikinya, atau akses [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) untuk memverifikasi apakah ada tindakan tertunda yang perlu kamu selesaikan di akunmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"Jika kamu adalah **pemilik** akun Pay-As-You-Go atau Subscription, kamu perlu membuat akun IBM Cloud dan memberikan informasi penagihan untuk verifikasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu **diundang untuk bergabung** ke sebuah akun, cukup terima undangan email dan ikuti [langkah-langkah yang diberikan](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) untuk mendapatkan akses tanpa perlu memberikan informasi penagihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr "**Pemilik akun Trial** bisa membuat instance Open Plan selama 30 hari tanpa memberikan informasi penagihan. Di akhir masa trial, pengguna harus memberikan informasi penagihan untuk memverifikasi dan terus menggunakan akun mereka. Pengguna *tidak akan dikenakan biaya* jika mereka terus menggunakan Open Plan gratis, tetapi bisa memilih untuk beralih ke paket berbayar lainnya saat itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang akun IBM Cloud, kunjungi halaman [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Dukungan open-source {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-conduct), PDF license agreements for [individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and [corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), and the [contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) guides.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [Sumber daya open-source](/guides/) untuk detail tentang cara berkontribusi kode ke Qiskit. Informasi di sana mencakup [kode etik](/guides/code-of-conduct), perjanjian lisensi PDF untuk kontributor [individu](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) dan [korporat](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf), [strategi versi](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), serta panduan [kontributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) dan [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To report bugs, make feature requests, and see what's coming in future releases, visit the individual GitHub repositories:\n"
msgstr "Untuk melaporkan bug, membuat permintaan fitur, dan melihat apa yang akan hadir di rilis mendatang, kunjungi repositori GitHub masing-masing:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "[Qiskit Transpiler Service](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-transpiler)\n"
msgid "[Qiskit AI-Powered Transpiler](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-transpiler)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Transpiler Service](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-transpiler)\n"

